@startuml
title login screen visual states

[*] --> EmptyForm
EmptyForm --> Submitting : user clicks Sign In
Submitting --> Success : valid credentials
Submitting --> AuthenticationFailed : 401 generic failure

AuthenticationFailed --> EmptyForm : user edits input
Success --> [*]

state EmptyForm
state Submitting
state Success
state AuthenticationFailed

note right of AuthenticationFailed
Visual test should confirm
generic auth failure copy and styling.
No account-state-specific leakage
should be visible in the UI.
end note

note right of Success
Successful login state should
carry a JWT returned from the
current auth boundary.
end note

@enduml
